msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Tama o mali: Unang naikonsepto ang quantum computing noong 1990s.\">\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "False.  While the first experimental quantum computer was created in 1998, the potential for quantum computing was identified by Richard Feynman as far back as 1981.\n"
msgstr "Mali. Kahit ang unang experimental na quantum computer ay nilikha noong 1998, ang potensyal ng quantum computing ay nakilala na ni Richard Feynman noong 1981.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Key takeaways {#key-takeaways}"
msgstr "Mga pangunahing aral {#key-takeaways}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can keep these key takeaways in mind:\n"
msgstr "Maaari mong isaalang-alang ang mga pangunahing araling ito:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quantum computing represents a new computing paradigm that can work in unison with conventional computers.\n"
msgstr "Kumakatawan ang quantum computing sa isang bagong computing paradigm na maaaring magtrabaho nang magkasama sa mga konvensyonal na computer.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "It will enable us to understand our world differently and solve some previously intractable problems.\n"
msgstr "Magbibigay-daan ito sa atin na maunawaan ang ating mundo sa ibang paraan at malutas ang ilang dating hindi malulutas na mga problema.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "While quantum computing cannot yet outperform methods in use today, organizations can take steps today to prepare for this fundamental change in computing.\n"
msgstr "Kahit hindi pa kayang lampasan ng quantum computing ang mga pamamaraang ginagamit ngayon, maaaring magsagawa ng mga hakbang ngayon ang mga organisasyon para maghanda para sa pundamental na pagbabagong ito sa computing.\n"

